// A reused subagent pid is not that worker.
// A missing start time still follows the live pid.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE reuse ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG reuse law

IMPULSE reuse 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "reuse" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
